WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.934
-Republicans
and right-wing pundits

00:00:02.934 --> 00:00:05.601
have created a mythology that is
totally unmoored from reality,

00:00:05.601 --> 00:00:07.000
in which Donald Trump
was the one

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.601
who was tough on Vladimir Putin

00:00:08.601 --> 00:00:10.901
and would've somehow stopped
Putin from invading Ukraine.

00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:12.834
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:12.834 --> 00:00:17.901
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:17.901 --> 00:00:20.367
I feel like it's worth
taking a step back

00:00:20.367 --> 00:00:22.334
and remembering the whole reason

00:00:22.334 --> 00:00:23.834
Trump got impeached
the first time.

00:00:23.834 --> 00:00:24.868
I know it's hard to remember

00:00:24.868 --> 00:00:26.734
because Trump melted all
of our brains

00:00:26.734 --> 00:00:29.634
by overloading us
with nonstop chaos and insanity.

00:00:29.634 --> 00:00:32.400
History Channel's going to have
to launch its own version

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.367
of ESPN2,
called History Channel...

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.100
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:38.701
[ Transatlantic accent ]
The year was 2019.

00:00:38.701 --> 00:00:40.400
"Old Town Road" was
at the top of the charts

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:41.634
and everyone was buzzing

00:00:41.634 --> 00:00:43.534
about the impeachment
of one Donald J. Trump.

00:00:43.534 --> 00:00:44.801
Give 'em hell, Donald J.

00:00:44.801 --> 00:00:46.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.467 --> 00:00:48.567
Trump got impeached specifically

00:00:48.567 --> 00:00:50.300
because he tried
to extort Ukraine

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:52.067
to help him cheat
in the 2020 election

00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:54.033
by holding up military aid

00:00:54.033 --> 00:00:57.634
in a phone call with Ukraine's
President Volodymyr Zelenskyy,

00:00:57.634 --> 00:00:59.734
the same Zelenskyy
who is now, once again,

00:00:59.734 --> 00:01:01.968
asking the U.S.
for more military assistance.

00:01:01.968 --> 00:01:05.100
If you'll recall, Zelenskyy
specifically asked Trump

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:07.567
to provide more
of an anti-tank missile system

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:10.167
known as a Javelin,
and that's when Trump tried

00:01:10.167 --> 00:01:12.367
to dangle the military aid
over his head.

00:01:12.367 --> 00:01:13.167
Zelenskyy told Trump...

00:01:23.968 --> 00:01:25.100
To which Trump responded...

00:01:27.501 --> 00:01:28.534
Remember that?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.534 --> 00:01:29.834
It's not your fault
if you don't.

00:01:29.834 --> 00:01:32.000
To find that transcript,
we had to send our researchers

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.634
down into the bowels of 30 Rock

00:01:33.634 --> 00:01:35.200
with flashlights
and magnifying glasses

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:37.234
to sift through rolls
of microfiche,

00:01:37.234 --> 00:01:39.467
like they were Nic Cage looking
for a secret code hidden

00:01:39.467 --> 00:01:40.901
[ Laughter ]
on the back of the Constitution.

00:01:40.901 --> 00:01:42.834
When they found it,
after weeks of searching,

00:01:42.834 --> 00:01:44.100
they ran up to my office

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:46.033
with a little piece
of parchment in their hands,

00:01:46.033 --> 00:01:47.334
and they said, "Mr. Meyers,

00:01:47.334 --> 00:01:50.133
we found the transcript."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.133 --> 00:01:53.067
And then I had to blow dust
just to read the words.

00:01:54.133 --> 00:01:56.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:58.567 --> 00:02:00.734
And then I said, "Dear God!

00:02:00.734 --> 00:02:04.167
Do you know how old this is?

00:02:04.167 --> 00:02:06.567
This happened all the way
back in

00:02:06.567 --> 00:02:07.767
2019."

00:02:07.767 --> 00:02:12.133
[ Suspenseful music climbs ]
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.133 --> 00:02:13.968
[ Lightning strikes,
thunder crashes ]

00:02:13.968 --> 00:02:16.901
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:21.734 --> 00:02:23.901
So Trump used the aid
Ukraine desperately wanted

00:02:23.901 --> 00:02:26.133
as a bargaining chip
to empower himself politically

00:02:26.133 --> 00:02:28.400
and, yet, yesterday,
after Zelenskyy's

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:31.000
virtual address to Congress
pleading for more aid,

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:33.501
House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy had the gall

00:02:33.501 --> 00:02:36.234
to claim it was Joe Biden
who didn't give Ukraine

00:02:36.234 --> 00:02:38.200
the military assistance
they were asking for.

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:39.868
-I've had conversations
with the president

00:02:39.868 --> 00:02:43.300
long before this moment came.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:46.834
My advice to him was provide
them the armament earlier

00:02:46.834 --> 00:02:49.601
to deter Putin from ever making
these decisions.

00:02:49.601 --> 00:02:51.868
The entire time,
President Biden always said

00:02:51.868 --> 00:02:54.367
it would be the sanctions
afterwards.

00:02:54.367 --> 00:02:55.634
And then,
when the sanctions came,

00:02:55.634 --> 00:02:58.067
he said it'd take months
to work.

00:02:58.067 --> 00:03:00.901
Well, Ukrainian people
cannot wait months.

00:03:00.901 --> 00:03:02.467
-Are you for real?

00:03:02.467 --> 00:03:04.133
Does your cable package not have

00:03:04.133 --> 00:03:06.033
History Channel...?

00:03:06.033 --> 00:03:07.267
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.267 --> 00:03:08.734
You're saying Biden is the one

00:03:08.734 --> 00:03:10.334
who should've given Ukraine
the aid sooner?

00:03:10.334 --> 00:03:12.968
The guy you supported tried
to extort Ukraine

00:03:12.968 --> 00:03:14.767
like a mob boss counting singles

00:03:14.767 --> 00:03:16.601
in the back room
of a strip club.

00:03:16.601 --> 00:03:19.367
'Please, Mr. Trump, you can't
tell my wife I was here."

00:03:19.367 --> 00:03:20.601
[ As Trump ]
That's no problem.

00:03:20.601 --> 00:03:21.634
[ Laughter ]
That's no problem at all.

00:03:21.634 --> 00:03:23.734
I would like you
to do us a favor, though.

00:03:23.734 --> 00:03:26.667
I need you to help us plant
some dirt on the mayor.

00:03:26.667 --> 00:03:28.534
You're going to tell people
he married his cousin.

00:03:28.534 --> 00:03:30.200
[ As Giuliani ]
It's true. I did.
It was an accident.

00:03:30.267 --> 00:03:32.234
[ Laughter and applause ]
It was an accident.

00:03:32.234 --> 00:03:33.968
And it was only for 14 years.

00:03:33.968 --> 00:03:36.567
[ Laughter ]
I think these guys
genuinely believe

00:03:36.567 --> 00:03:38.501
we don't remember
the Trump administration at all.

00:03:38.501 --> 00:03:41.400
Maybe they thought that thing
Trump does with his hands

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:44.334
was a Jedi mind trick.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.334 --> 00:03:46.534
Of course, Trump could never
pull off a Jedi mind trick

00:03:46.534 --> 00:03:48.100
because he doesn't
have any focus.

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:49.801
[ As Trump ]
These are not the droids
you're looking for.

00:03:49.801 --> 00:03:51.601
I got these droids
from my very good friend

00:03:51.601 --> 00:03:53.367
Anakin Skywalker.

00:03:53.367 --> 00:03:55.234
Big guy, strong guy.

00:03:55.234 --> 00:03:56.400
Came up to me,
tears in his eyes.

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:57.300
He said, "Sir."

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:59.033
[ Laughter ]
He said, "Sir,

00:03:59.033 --> 00:04:01.901
we love what you're doing
for the star system.

00:04:01.901 --> 00:04:03.067
[ Laughter and applause ]
We love it.

00:04:03.067 --> 00:04:05.701
You know he's Darth Vader now.

00:04:05.701 --> 00:04:07.000
Anakin is Darth Vader.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:08.334
Not a lot of people know that.

00:04:08.334 --> 00:04:11.400
[ Laughter ]
Anyway, you were looking
for some droids.

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:13.100
[ Laughter ]

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:16.033
They all want us to think Trump
magically would've fixed this

00:04:16.033 --> 00:04:17.467
by being tough on Putin,

00:04:17.467 --> 00:04:19.000
when we all know
the opposite was true.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:22.200
Trump slobbered praise
all over Putin any chance he had

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:23.734
and was desperate to be
Putin's friend

00:04:23.734 --> 00:04:25.567
and, yet, Trump apologists
continue to craft

00:04:25.567 --> 00:04:27.400
this insane mythology where,
somehow,

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:30.300
Trump would've stopped Putin
from invading Ukraine.

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:33.300
Some of them have even come up
with elaborate allegories

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:35.667
to explain Trump's
supposed toughness.

00:04:35.667 --> 00:04:38.667
-They didn't do this
on Trump's watch, Russia,

00:04:38.667 --> 00:04:40.634
because Trump would've
kicked their ass.

00:04:40.634 --> 00:04:42.701
-This never would've
happened under Trump.

00:04:42.701 --> 00:04:44.334
-Why didn't Putin
do this

00:04:44.334 --> 00:04:46.234
when Trump was president?

00:04:46.234 --> 00:04:50.300
And I don't bring up
President Trump that much, okay?

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:52.300
[ Laughter ]
But I tell you right now

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:55.300
that he didn't do it
when Trump was president.

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:57.968
-What we are seeing
in Ukraine,

00:04:57.968 --> 00:04:59.801
courtesy of Russia,

00:04:59.801 --> 00:05:03.934
is merely a preview
of what can happen

00:05:03.934 --> 00:05:08.000
when America signals weakness.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:12.934
I've read that, in the jungles,
the mighty do not have to fight.

00:05:12.934 --> 00:05:15.801
They say that,
when the bull elephant lives,

00:05:15.801 --> 00:05:19.067
the herd is peaceful
and prosperous.

00:05:19.067 --> 00:05:20.634
But in his absence,

00:05:20.634 --> 00:05:26.234
confusion, disorder,
and destruction ensues.

00:05:26.234 --> 00:05:27.534
Well, when I get
through speaking,

00:05:27.534 --> 00:05:31.601
the next voice you hear will be,
in a little while,

00:05:31.601 --> 00:05:35.534
will be that of our own
bull elephant, Donald Trump.

00:05:35.534 --> 00:05:38.434
-Are you reading from a rejected
children's book

00:05:38.434 --> 00:05:39.400
about Donald Trump?

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:40.968
[ Laughter ]

00:05:40.968 --> 00:05:43.067
[ As McMaster ]
You see, the bull elephant lives
in the jungle

00:05:43.067 --> 00:05:44.501
with all the others animals

00:05:44.501 --> 00:05:46.968
and, when he's home,
the herd is peaceful.

00:05:46.968 --> 00:05:50.367
And, because it is peaceful,
he has time to use Twitter.

00:05:50.367 --> 00:05:52.901
But because he only has a trunk
to type with,

00:05:52.901 --> 00:05:54.267
there are often misspellings

00:05:54.267 --> 00:05:56.133
or things accidentally
in all-caps.

00:05:56.133 --> 00:05:58.267
Still, he is an elephant
who tweets,

00:05:58.267 --> 00:05:59.467
and that's pretty cool.

00:05:59.467 --> 00:06:02.033
[ Laughter ]

00:06:02.033 --> 00:06:03.601
Also, can we go back
to this real quick?

00:06:03.601 --> 00:06:06.767
-I don't bring up
President Trump that much.

00:06:06.767 --> 00:06:08.934
-Yeah, me neither.

00:06:08.934 --> 00:06:13.467
[ Laughter and applause ]
Today is such a weird outlier.

00:06:13.467 --> 00:06:15.367
[ Laughter ]

00:06:15.367 --> 00:06:17.801
For what it's worth, I think
it's justified to bring him up.

00:06:17.801 --> 00:06:19.267
He's the leader
of the Republican Party

00:06:19.267 --> 00:06:21.200
and their likely nominee
in 2024.

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:23.534
But, yes, I do talk
about Trump a lot.

00:06:23.534 --> 00:06:25.567
I even talked about him
when my psychiatrist

00:06:25.567 --> 00:06:27.234
made me take an inkblot test,

00:06:27.234 --> 00:06:28.968
but in my defense,
it did look like this.

00:06:28.968 --> 00:06:30.734
[ Laughter ]

00:06:30.734 --> 00:06:31.968
Bull elephant!

00:06:31.968 --> 00:06:34.000
[ Laughter ]
There was also another part

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:36.267
of that Jeanine Pirro tirade
I really enjoyed,

00:06:36.267 --> 00:06:38.267
where she went off
on the Biden administration

00:06:38.267 --> 00:06:41.200
for reaching out to social
media influencers on TikTok

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:43.434
to talk to them
about the war in Ukraine.

00:06:43.434 --> 00:06:47.300
-Biden is responsible
for the decline of the West!

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:50.300
What we are seeing right now
is a --

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.534
I can't say the word --
is a wuss!

00:06:52.534 --> 00:06:55.567
-[ Laughs ]
-We've got a bully in the yard,

00:06:55.567 --> 00:06:58.067
in the playground yard,
in the schoolyard,

00:06:58.067 --> 00:07:00.467
and everybody's back
at the fence, alright?

00:07:00.467 --> 00:07:01.901
-How do you know --
-All we -- Wait, wait a minute.

00:07:01.901 --> 00:07:03.100
Let me finish.

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:05.133
[ Laughter ]
All we have to do is

00:07:05.133 --> 00:07:10.033
we have enough oil in Canada,
the United States, and Mexico

00:07:10.033 --> 00:07:12.567
and we could be
our own superpowers,

00:07:12.567 --> 00:07:14.634
but right now,
the Biden administration

00:07:14.634 --> 00:07:17.367
is not only hurting
the Americans and all this

00:07:17.367 --> 00:07:21.133
#BlamePutin TikTok nonsense.
-[ Laughs ]

00:07:21.133 --> 00:07:22.667
[ Laughter ]
-All this is crap!

00:07:22.667 --> 00:07:25.734
-I'm sorry, I have to ask,
who is mixing your drinks?

00:07:25.734 --> 00:07:27.834
[ Laughter and applause ]
Because, you know,
you're supposed

00:07:27.834 --> 00:07:30.634
to put something nonalcoholic
in there too, right?

00:07:30.634 --> 00:07:32.267
[ As Pirro ]
I'll have a vodka soda,

00:07:32.267 --> 00:07:34.200
but replace the soda
with tequila

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:35.901
and replace the ice
with whiskey

00:07:35.901 --> 00:07:37.200
and hold on.
Let me finish!

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:40.667
[ Laughter ]
Replaced the vodka
with more vodka!

00:07:40.667 --> 00:07:42.868
[ Laughter and applause ]
So, Trump's sycophants

00:07:42.868 --> 00:07:45.234
have all bought in
to the ludicrous idea

00:07:45.234 --> 00:07:47.734
that Trump, somehow,
would've stopped Putin.

00:07:47.734 --> 00:07:50.367
Trump himself has repeated
that claim on TV recently,

00:07:50.367 --> 00:07:52.267
although he's been
weirdly vague about it.

00:07:52.267 --> 00:07:55.200
-This would not have happened
during my administration.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:56.901
In fact,
some people were saying,

00:07:56.901 --> 00:07:59.367
"Why didn't this take place

00:07:59.367 --> 00:08:02.501
over the last four years,
during our administration?"

00:08:02.501 --> 00:08:04.100
And it didn't
for a very good reason,

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:06.067
and I'll explain that to you,
someday.

00:08:06.067 --> 00:08:08.234
[ Laughter ]
Oh, well,

00:08:08.234 --> 00:08:11.300
by all means,
keep that secret to yourself,

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:13.200
former U.S. president.

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:14.634
[ Laughter ]

00:08:14.634 --> 00:08:16.501
That's like if, when COVID hit,
Obama said --

00:08:16.501 --> 00:08:17.868
[ As Obama ]
Now, I got a cure,

00:08:17.868 --> 00:08:20.267
and I'm going to tell you
what it is, uh...

00:08:20.267 --> 00:08:21.200
when I'm good and ready.

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:22.567
[ Laughter ]

00:08:22.567 --> 00:08:24.834
Trump treats foreign policy
like he's doing an ad

00:08:24.834 --> 00:08:26.267
for women's perfume.

00:08:26.267 --> 00:08:27.234
"What's our secret?

00:08:27.234 --> 00:08:29.067
Maybe I'll tell you about it.

00:08:29.067 --> 00:08:30.100
Some Day."

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:32.734
-Some Day by Calvin Klein.

00:08:32.734 --> 00:08:34.601
[ Laughter ]
-And then this week,

00:08:34.601 --> 00:08:36.300
Trump's half-finished
claymation sons

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:37.534
picked up where he left off,

00:08:37.534 --> 00:08:40.000
[ Laughter ]
with Don Jr. suggesting

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.300
that Trump should meet
with NATO next week,

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:43.734
instead of Biden.
He tweeted...

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:53.567
Why would NATO want
to see Trump?

00:08:53.567 --> 00:08:55.067
He repeatedly slammed NATO.

00:08:55.067 --> 00:08:57.400
He's like their
WWE wrestling villain.

00:08:57.400 --> 00:08:59.100
[ Laughter ]
Would they know he was there

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:00.968
when they heard
his entrance music?

00:09:00.968 --> 00:09:02.367
[ German accent ]
So, we need to be careful

00:09:02.367 --> 00:09:05.267
about what steps we take next,
as to not inflame tensions

00:09:05.267 --> 00:09:06.601
-♪ Fun to stay at the ♪
-and, obviously --

00:09:06.601 --> 00:09:08.834
-♪ YMCA ♪
-My God.

00:09:08.834 --> 00:09:11.033
-♪ It's fun to stay at the ♪
-That's Donald Trump music!

00:09:11.033 --> 00:09:13.200
-♪ YMCA ♪

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:16.667
[ Laughter ]

00:09:16.667 --> 00:09:18.734
And then, Don Jr.'s copy

00:09:18.734 --> 00:09:21.067
of a copy of a fax brother
Eric Trump

00:09:21.067 --> 00:09:24.234
[ Laughter ]
went on TV and made
a similar claim,

00:09:24.234 --> 00:09:25.701
but with even dumber reasons.

00:09:25.701 --> 00:09:27.467
-Listen, my father would,
you know, call up

00:09:27.467 --> 00:09:28.801
and he would've said,
"Vladimir,

00:09:28.801 --> 00:09:29.868
don't even think about it.

00:09:29.868 --> 00:09:31.467
Don't even try us.

00:09:31.467 --> 00:09:33.701
I'm telling you, it's not going
to work out very well for you."

00:09:33.701 --> 00:09:35.267
-You really think that's how
the conversation would go?

00:09:35.267 --> 00:09:36.701
You sound like you're talking
to a dog

00:09:36.701 --> 00:09:37.934
who's about to pee on the rug.

00:09:37.934 --> 00:09:39.667
[ Laughter ]
Of course,

00:09:39.667 --> 00:09:41.467
if Trump talked to a dog
the way he talked to Putin,

00:09:41.467 --> 00:09:43.467
he would immediately give in
every time the dog complained.

00:09:43.467 --> 00:09:45.133
[ As Trump ]
Sparky, don't do it.
Don't even think about it.

00:09:45.133 --> 00:09:47.200
[ Laughter ]
Don't you dare.
Don't you dare pee on the rug,

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:49.200
or I'll have to shake that jar
full of loose change.

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:51.667
-[ Growling ]
-Or, or, alternatively,

00:09:51.667 --> 00:09:53.667
pee wherever you want.
[ Laughter ]

00:09:53.667 --> 00:09:56.067
This is your house, too, Sparky.
You're man's best friend

00:09:56.067 --> 00:09:57.701
and that makes you
as much of a human as I am.

00:09:57.701 --> 00:09:59.534
[ Laughter ]
Wizz away,
just not on the good rug.

00:09:59.534 --> 00:10:00.667
-[ Growling ]
[ Laughter ]

00:10:00.667 --> 00:10:02.501
-Or right in the middle
of the good rug.

00:10:02.501 --> 00:10:04.400
[ Laughter ]
I was just saying to Melania,

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:06.868
I feel like this rug could use
a big, yellow, wet spot.

00:10:06.868 --> 00:10:08.400
Now, we have it.
We worked together

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:09.601
and now, we have it, Sparky.

00:10:09.601 --> 00:10:11.367
[ Laughter ]
In the last few days,

00:10:11.367 --> 00:10:13.200
there's been
some cautious optimism

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:14.334
that a diplomatic solution

00:10:14.334 --> 00:10:15.634
to this conflict
might be possible.

00:10:15.634 --> 00:10:17.534
Even Zelenskyy himself
has hinted

00:10:17.534 --> 00:10:19.100
at a possible compromise.

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:20.334
That's what we need to do --

00:10:20.334 --> 00:10:22.067
help the millions of Ukrainians
who are suffering

00:10:22.067 --> 00:10:24.434
and provide support
for a possible peace deal.

00:10:24.434 --> 00:10:26.934
What we don't need are reckless
threats of escalation

00:10:26.934 --> 00:10:28.734
from people who think Trump,
of all people,

00:10:28.734 --> 00:10:29.968
would've put a stop to this.

00:10:29.968 --> 00:10:31.434
The idea that Donald Trump
would've been tough

00:10:31.434 --> 00:10:33.067
on Vladimir Putin is,
quite frankly...

00:10:33.067 --> 00:10:34.400
-Bull.
-Crap!

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:35.634
[ Laughter ]
-Ooh.

00:10:37.167 --> 00:10:38.400
[ Laughter ]

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:39.734
This has been "A Closer Look."

00:10:39.734 --> 00:10:43.634
♪♪

00:10:43.634 --> 00:10:45.100
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:46.400
over two million meals a year

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:48.601
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:10:48.601 --> 00:10:50.067
cancer, and other
serious illnesses

00:10:50.067 --> 00:10:51.567
and they need your help,
now, more than ever.

00:10:51.567 --> 00:10:53.767
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:10:53.767 --> 00:10:56.300
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

